                                "sense_id": "2650501d-170c-3b42-b51c-d78434546042",
                                "text": "Henry never lived down his reputation as a Bluebeard, and only a few years before his death sporting gentlemen in Antwerp were laying bets that the English Lothario would divorce and marry once again."
                            }
